WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.310
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.580 --> 01:38.880
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.310 --> 01:41.740
[Episode 29]

4
02:05.780 --> 02:08.639
Congratulations on making it out alive, Mr. Jiang.

5
02:11.500 --> 02:13.500
I'm Mu Linsen, Commander-in-Chief

6
02:13.840 --> 02:15.500
of Chizhou's Defense Forces.

7
02:17.340 --> 02:20.000
I've heard a great deal about you, Commander Mu.

8
02:20.650 --> 02:22.000
You were once the top man

9
02:22.579 --> 02:24.240
under Military Governor Chu.

10
02:25.680 --> 02:26.610
You're too kind.

11
02:27.710 --> 02:28.910
I must say, Mr. Jiang,

12
02:29.500 --> 02:31.090
you've surprised me.

13
02:31.579 --> 02:32.020
After enduring

14
02:32.020 --> 02:33.810
such prolonged torment

15
02:34.090 --> 02:35.650
and surviving against all odds,

16
02:35.650 --> 02:37.750
you remain remarkably composed.

17
02:44.780 --> 02:46.520
The food here is quite decent.

18
02:47.620 --> 02:48.400
Give it a try.

19
02:58.530 --> 03:00.530
A man of your stature, Commander Mu,

20
03:01.360 --> 03:03.090
wouldn't go to all this trouble

21
03:03.530 --> 03:04.400
to see me

22
03:04.470 --> 03:05.930
just for a meal, would you?

23
03:07.620 --> 03:08.650
Two years ago,

24
03:09.680 --> 03:10.870
Mr. Jiang, you were traveling south

25
03:10.870 --> 03:12.310
with your fiancée, Miss Ye,

26
03:12.310 --> 03:13.900
and her mother

27
03:15.130 --> 03:16.190
when

28
03:16.280 --> 03:18.910
Yu Changxuan did everything in his power to stop you.

29
03:18.910 --> 03:21.180
Ms. Ye perished in a fire,

30
03:22.500 --> 03:25.090
and you fell off a cliff during the struggle.

31
03:26.400 --> 03:28.310
After lying unconscious for days,

32
03:28.310 --> 03:29.470
you were eventually

33
03:30.310 --> 03:32.840
confined to a labor camp in a mining district.

34
03:36.180 --> 03:38.110
Commander Mu, it seems you've gone

35
03:38.940 --> 03:40.790
to considerable lengths to look into my affairs.

36
03:40.790 --> 03:42.850
You went to such trouble to rescue me.

37
03:44.579 --> 03:46.380
May I ask what you want in return?

38
03:47.530 --> 03:48.870
There's something else

39
03:49.370 --> 03:50.870
you may not know.

40
03:52.900 --> 03:54.240
Back then, Miss Ye

41
03:54.500 --> 03:56.130
suffered smoke inhalation,

42
03:56.860 --> 03:59.190
sustained injuries, and lost her memory.

43
03:59.300 --> 04:01.830
Yu Changxuan took advantage of her condition

44
04:02.090 --> 04:04.020
and tricked her into marrying him.

45
04:05.620 --> 04:06.630
She's now

46
04:07.840 --> 04:09.970
the Fifth Young Madam of the Yu family.

47
04:48.370 --> 04:49.270
Mr. Jiang,

48
04:51.980 --> 04:53.010
I can help you.

49
04:56.500 --> 04:58.370
Shang Hongwen, the editor-in-chief,

50
04:58.370 --> 04:59.420
is one of my men.

51
05:01.040 --> 05:02.870
I had him search far and wide

52
05:03.360 --> 05:05.560
for promising young literary talents,

53
05:06.300 --> 05:07.900
and he recommended you to me.

54
05:08.770 --> 05:10.030
I've read your article

55
05:10.370 --> 05:11.950
analyzing the financial networks

56
05:11.950 --> 05:14.150
of the northern and southern warlords.

57
05:14.420 --> 05:15.500
It was incisive

58
05:15.920 --> 05:17.720
and showed remarkable insight.

59
05:17.770 --> 05:19.310
Your pen

60
05:20.540 --> 05:22.600
is more powerful than ten divisions.

61
05:31.190 --> 05:32.060
So

62
05:32.560 --> 05:34.130
you want me to put my pen

63
05:35.480 --> 05:36.500
at your service.

64
05:37.060 --> 05:39.120
If you want to take down Yu Changxuan,

65
05:40.360 --> 05:42.159
I'm the only one who can help you.

66
05:43.310 --> 05:45.240
Surely you don't want to see Miss Ye

67
05:45.630 --> 05:47.159
smiling sweetly

68
05:47.240 --> 05:48.770
at your enemy day after day.

69
05:58.300 --> 05:59.960
This is a token of my goodwill.

70
06:04.250 --> 06:05.710
You have a long road ahead.

71
06:07.500 --> 06:08.540
Mr. Jiang,

72
06:10.220 --> 06:11.480
you'll find it useful.

73
06:23.480 --> 06:24.020
Hello?

74
06:24.500 --> 06:25.100
Pingjun.

75
06:25.950 --> 06:26.680
Changxuan?

76
06:27.360 --> 06:28.660
What made you call me?

77
06:29.360 --> 06:30.830
Bayberries are plentiful here,

78
06:30.830 --> 06:32.290
and they taste wonderful.

79
06:32.460 --> 06:33.220
I've had my aides

80
06:33.220 --> 06:34.480
send some back for you.

81
06:35.300 --> 06:37.540
You didn't have to go to all that trouble.

82
06:37.540 --> 06:39.340
I thought you'd like to try some.

83
06:39.690 --> 06:40.560
I've got things to do,

84
06:40.560 --> 06:41.490
so I'd better go.

85
06:48.250 --> 06:49.380
You miss me a little,

86
06:50.630 --> 06:51.500
don't you?

87
07:01.040 --> 07:02.540
What's that saying?

88
07:04.330 --> 07:06.250
"Meet or part, live or die,

89
07:06.950 --> 07:08.560
we've made an oath, you and I.

90
07:10.060 --> 07:11.660
Give me your hand, I'll hold,

91
07:13.450 --> 07:14.910
and live with me till old."

92
07:18.060 --> 07:20.750
All right, you're out on patrol.

93
07:21.750 --> 07:24.350
Aren't you afraid someone might overhear you?

94
07:25.500 --> 07:26.600
As long as you know

95
07:27.600 --> 07:30.060
what's in my heart, that's all that matters.

96
07:33.630 --> 07:35.890
You hang up first. I'll hang up after you.

97
07:55.450 --> 07:57.590
[Groom: Yu Changxuan]

98
08:02.780 --> 08:04.540
[Marriage Certificate]

99
08:08.840 --> 08:12.590
[Marriage Certificate]

100
08:14.860 --> 08:16.860
I'll be waiting for you to come home.

101
08:24.330 --> 08:26.740
The Propaganda Department is the government's mouthpiece,

102
08:26.740 --> 08:27.650
riddled with tangled connections

103
08:27.650 --> 08:29.050
and competing factions.

104
08:29.930 --> 08:31.300
For Jiang Xueting to have secured

105
08:31.300 --> 08:32.549
his position

106
08:32.549 --> 08:33.840
and won such favor

107
08:34.409 --> 08:35.600
in so little time

108
08:36.620 --> 08:37.860
is no small feat.

109
08:38.340 --> 08:39.940
Out of tens of thousands of candidates,

110
08:39.940 --> 08:42.370
he earned a government-sponsored study-abroad scholarship.

111
08:42.370 --> 08:44.630
That alone makes him one of the very best.

112
08:45.630 --> 08:48.500
And now he's proving himself worthy of all the praise.

113
08:48.500 --> 08:51.030
He's certainly someone we can put to good use.

114
08:52.860 --> 08:54.460
He's about to meet Second Young Lady Tao,

115
08:54.460 --> 08:55.740
isn't he?

116
08:57.980 --> 09:00.180
Everything is going according to plan.

117
09:01.580 --> 09:02.710
As for the Yu family,

118
09:03.720 --> 09:05.850
I've prepared a special gift for them.

119
09:12.210 --> 09:13.950
[Investigation into the Yu Army's Defeat at the Battle of Qingshi Ridge]

120
09:14.630 --> 09:15.960
Have you verified everything?

121
09:15.960 --> 09:16.870
Everyone leaves a trace

122
09:16.870 --> 09:18.120
of what they've done.

123
09:19.080 --> 09:20.510
Even a seasoned schemer like Tao Xili

124
09:20.510 --> 09:21.530
is no exception.

125
09:24.250 --> 09:25.130
The marriage alliance

126
09:25.130 --> 09:27.260
between his family and Yu Zhongquan's

127
09:28.220 --> 09:30.020
is going to make for quite a show.

128
09:33.960 --> 09:35.060
Extra! Extra!

129
09:35.220 --> 09:36.050
The Huai Daily has breaking news!

130
09:36.050 --> 09:37.440
A long-buried battlefield injustice exposed!

131
09:37.440 --> 09:38.370
[In the fifth year of the Republic,]

132
09:38.370 --> 09:40.870
[the Yu Army's Fourth and Ninth Armies]

133
09:40.870 --> 09:42.530
[were scheduled to encircle the Wan warlord forces]

134
09:42.530 --> 09:43.670
[at Qingshi Ridge.]

135
09:43.890 --> 09:45.650
[Tao Xili,]

136
09:45.650 --> 09:46.460
[then president of the Sujing Chamber of Commerce,]

137
09:46.460 --> 09:47.820
[publicly raised military funds]

138
09:47.820 --> 09:47.950
[to support the Yu Army.]

139
09:47.950 --> 09:49.250
[Huai Daily: Special Report]

140
09:49.250 --> 09:50.940
[Meanwhile, he was secretly supplying gold bars to the enemy,]

141
09:50.940 --> 09:51.010
[leaving the vanguard regiment led by Yu Mingxuan...]

142
09:51.010 --> 09:53.100
[Battlefield Injustice Exposed: New Evidence of the Yu-Tao Feud]

143
09:53.100 --> 09:54.220
[Exposed to five times the Wan army's firepower]

144
09:54.220 --> 09:56.460
[at Heishitan.]

145
09:56.600 --> 09:57.410
Looks like

146
09:57.770 --> 09:58.410
Tao Xili

147
09:58.650 --> 10:00.710
was hedging his bets with both sides.

148
10:00.860 --> 10:01.050
[Huai Daily]

149
10:01.050 --> 10:02.240
He publicly supported us

150
10:02.240 --> 10:04.300
while secretly funding the Wan army.

151
10:04.370 --> 10:05.500
No matter who won,

152
10:05.700 --> 10:06.890
he'd profit.

153
10:08.030 --> 10:09.560
Then Young Master Mingxuan

154
10:09.870 --> 10:11.200
wouldn't have had to...

155
10:23.860 --> 10:24.520
Changxuan.

156
10:24.960 --> 10:25.560
What is it?

157
10:26.080 --> 10:27.410
Something's happened.

158
10:28.810 --> 10:29.430
[Huai Daily: Special Report]

159
10:29.450 --> 10:30.290
[Battlefield Injustice Exposed: New Evidence of the Yu-Tao Feud]

160
10:32.490 --> 10:32.640
[Battlefield Injustice Exposed: New Evidence of the Yu-Tao Feud]

161
10:32.640 --> 10:34.100
Get back to Nanhui at once.

162
10:45.200 --> 10:46.840
See this memorial tablet?

163
10:48.250 --> 10:49.170
It's for Mingxuan.

164
10:49.170 --> 10:50.940
[Memorial Tablet of Beloved Son, Yu Mingxuan]

165
10:51.250 --> 10:52.530
He was only 23

166
10:53.840 --> 10:55.630
when he died.

167
10:58.120 --> 11:00.720
He was my favorite son.

168
11:01.360 --> 11:01.500
I poured my heart and soul

169
11:01.500 --> 11:03.370
[Memorial Tablet of Beloved Son, Yu Mingxuan]

170
11:03.370 --> 11:04.980
into him.

171
11:06.440 --> 11:07.840
Your father is the reason

172
11:08.750 --> 11:10.100
I had to bury

173
11:10.130 --> 11:11.320
my own child.

174
11:12.440 --> 11:13.550
My father?

175
11:15.050 --> 11:16.460
What happened?

176
11:18.010 --> 11:19.470
The Huai Daily exposed it.

177
11:20.940 --> 11:23.140
Your father funded the enemy back then,

178
11:23.740 --> 11:25.670
changing the course of the battle.

179
11:25.720 --> 11:27.050
In other words,

180
11:27.220 --> 11:30.240
your father caused Mingxuan's death.

181
11:35.650 --> 11:37.030
How can that be?

182
11:38.410 --> 11:39.910
What's going on?

183
11:39.940 --> 11:41.750
A father's debts are his daughter's to pay.

184
11:41.750 --> 11:42.840
That's only right.

185
11:43.580 --> 11:44.740
Until the whole matter

186
11:44.740 --> 11:46.740
has been thoroughly investigated,

187
11:46.870 --> 11:48.320
you'll kneel here

188
11:48.410 --> 11:49.000
[Memorial Tablet of Beloved Son, Yu Mingxuan]

189
11:49.000 --> 11:50.860
and atone for your father's sins.

190
11:51.980 --> 11:52.650
Father...

191
12:07.700 --> 12:07.820
[Bring Honor to Your Ancestors and Bless Your Descendants]

192
12:07.820 --> 12:08.790
Zhongquan,

193
12:08.820 --> 12:10.030
there may be more to the story

194
12:10.030 --> 12:11.740
than what's in the paper.

195
12:11.820 --> 12:13.820
Changxuan is out on patrol right now.

196
12:13.820 --> 12:15.440
How are we supposed to explain this to him

197
12:15.440 --> 12:17.250
if you treat her like this?

198
12:17.250 --> 12:18.150
Explain what?

199
12:18.250 --> 12:19.600
Who's going to give me an explanation?

200
12:19.600 --> 12:20.240
Father,

201
12:20.240 --> 12:22.370
even if Tao Xili was involved,

202
12:22.460 --> 12:24.340
Pingjun knew nothing about it.

203
12:24.440 --> 12:27.530
Father, I know how much you loved Mingxuan,

204
12:27.840 --> 12:29.720
and I know you'll get justice for him.

205
12:29.720 --> 12:30.460
But at least

206
12:30.700 --> 12:32.100
wait until Changxuan gets back.

207
12:32.100 --> 12:32.960
That's right.

208
12:33.700 --> 12:34.500
Enough.

209
12:35.630 --> 12:36.830
I know what I'm doing.

210
12:39.150 --> 12:40.350
No one opens that lock

211
12:41.910 --> 12:42.880
without my permission.

212
12:42.880 --> 12:43.080
[Bring Honor to Your Ancestors and Bless Your Descendants]

213
12:43.080 --> 12:43.770
Father...

214
12:45.870 --> 12:48.120
Mother, what are we going to do?

215
12:50.250 --> 12:51.890
That stubborn old man!

216
13:44.650 --> 13:45.510
[Virtuous Character]

217
13:47.580 --> 13:48.600
Open the door!

218
13:49.080 --> 13:50.510
Fifth Young Master Yu, the Commander-in-Chief ordered

219
13:50.510 --> 13:53.170
-that without his permission, no one... -Move!

220
14:18.960 --> 14:20.200
You're back.

221
14:26.000 --> 14:26.860
It's all right.

222
14:28.360 --> 14:29.030
I'm here.

223
14:38.860 --> 14:39.580
Changxuan,

224
14:40.360 --> 14:41.420
what are you doing?

225
14:43.670 --> 14:44.940
Are you going

226
14:45.650 --> 14:46.620
to forget your own brother's death

227
14:46.620 --> 14:47.880
for the sake of a woman?

228
14:55.580 --> 14:56.550
Pingjun knew nothing about it

229
14:56.550 --> 14:57.750
from beginning to end,

230
14:57.750 --> 14:59.080
and she had no part in it.

231
14:59.460 --> 15:01.150
Those responsible should answer for their own actions.

232
15:01.150 --> 15:03.410
Why should she pay for her father's sins?

233
15:03.670 --> 15:06.370
Besides, someone must have an ulterior motive

234
15:06.910 --> 15:08.440
for bringing this up again.

235
15:09.270 --> 15:10.360
I've known since you were a child

236
15:10.360 --> 15:12.090
that you never liked Mingxuan.

237
15:12.720 --> 15:14.720
You wished he were dead, didn't you?

238
15:15.370 --> 15:16.390
Zhongquan,

239
15:16.480 --> 15:18.250
how can you say such a thing?

240
15:18.250 --> 15:20.650
How could our son think that way?

241
15:22.360 --> 15:23.170
I know

242
15:25.460 --> 15:27.080
you've always believed

243
15:28.460 --> 15:29.910
that I was the reason

244
15:30.750 --> 15:32.810
Yu Mingxuan died on the battlefield.

245
15:33.750 --> 15:34.890
Were you?

246
15:50.050 --> 15:50.750
Changxuan.

247
15:54.750 --> 15:55.810
What are you doing?

248
15:57.720 --> 15:58.510
What,

249
15:59.460 --> 16:00.990
are you going to kill me too?

250
16:04.580 --> 16:05.270
Go ahead.

251
16:06.500 --> 16:07.960
Ever since Mingxuan died,

252
16:08.480 --> 16:09.100
you've killed me

253
16:09.100 --> 16:10.830
in your heart countless times.

254
16:17.950 --> 16:22.940
[Bring Honor to Your Ancestors and Bless Your Descendants]

255
16:40.740 --> 16:42.130
Are you going

256
16:42.670 --> 16:43.550
to forget your own brother's death

257
16:43.550 --> 16:44.810
for the sake of a woman?

258
16:47.030 --> 16:47.670
Go ahead.

259
16:48.770 --> 16:50.230
Ever since Mingxuan died,

260
16:50.870 --> 16:51.500
you've killed me

261
16:51.500 --> 16:53.230
in your heart countless times.

262
17:02.890 --> 17:04.420
What are you doing out here?

263
17:04.900 --> 17:05.790
It's windy,

264
17:06.140 --> 17:07.540
and you're still so weak.

265
17:11.200 --> 17:13.380
If what's in the paper is true,

266
17:15.220 --> 17:16.400
I honestly don't know

267
17:16.400 --> 17:18.400
how I can face the rest of the family.

268
17:22.589 --> 17:23.990
What is it you want to say?

269
17:28.790 --> 17:29.660
Yu Changxuan,

270
17:31.550 --> 17:33.350
if all of this is true,

271
17:38.500 --> 17:40.500
then we should go our separate ways.

272
17:50.420 --> 17:52.640
Why is it that whenever you face a problem,

273
17:52.640 --> 17:54.110
you always try to push me away?

274
17:54.110 --> 17:55.850
I'm not trying to push you away.

275
17:56.460 --> 17:57.440
But you still have

276
17:57.440 --> 17:58.090
to explain yourself to your family.

277
17:58.090 --> 17:59.790
I don't want to be a burden to you.

278
17:59.790 --> 18:00.640
You've never been

279
18:00.640 --> 18:01.500
a burden to me.

280
18:02.770 --> 18:04.170
Ye Pingjun, listen to me.

281
18:04.590 --> 18:05.500
You'll never

282
18:06.400 --> 18:07.430
leave my side

283
18:07.460 --> 18:08.520
as long as you live.

284
18:12.400 --> 18:13.250
Not unless I die.

285
18:13.250 --> 18:14.400
Don't say that.

286
18:35.390 --> 18:36.430
Remember,

287
18:38.160 --> 18:39.160
I'm your husband.

288
18:51.590 --> 18:53.250
You can always trust me

289
18:54.720 --> 18:55.520
and lean on me.

290
19:42.160 --> 19:43.160
I asked around everywhere

291
19:43.160 --> 19:44.200
until my mouth went dry,

292
19:44.200 --> 19:46.330
but I couldn't find out anything else.

293
19:47.240 --> 19:48.440
I checked the report.

294
19:48.500 --> 19:49.510
Heavy rain

295
19:49.510 --> 19:51.940
washed out Datong Bridge, the planned retreat route,

296
19:51.940 --> 19:52.610
forcing Mingxuan

297
19:52.610 --> 19:54.250
to change the plan at the last minute.

298
19:54.250 --> 19:54.850
The signature

299
19:54.850 --> 19:56.200
was Mingxuan's own.

300
19:57.270 --> 19:59.180
Changxuan, what do you suspect?

301
20:00.400 --> 20:01.830
That bridge, too...

302
20:02.030 --> 20:03.950
Why couldn't it have collapsed two days later?

303
20:03.950 --> 20:04.880
It held up all that time,

304
20:04.880 --> 20:07.250
then had to collapse on the very day of the battle.

305
20:07.250 --> 20:08.530
If the plan had gone ahead,

306
20:08.530 --> 20:11.260
-back then he would've... -What did you just say?

307
20:11.530 --> 20:12.030
I said,

308
20:12.960 --> 20:15.560
why couldn't it have collapsed two days later?

309
20:16.140 --> 20:18.570
What time does the report say the bridge collapsed?

310
20:18.570 --> 20:19.830
The bridge collapsed early on the morning

311
20:19.830 --> 20:21.560
of the battle due to heavy rain.

312
20:34.970 --> 20:35.050
Zhangjia Village in Heishitan

313
20:35.050 --> 20:37.000
[Classified Archives of the Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

314
20:37.700 --> 20:39.300
was caught in the crossfire.

315
20:39.660 --> 20:41.460
As soon as the fighting stopped,

316
20:41.790 --> 20:44.010
the surviving villagers evacuated,

317
20:45.680 --> 20:47.210
crossing this very bridge.

318
20:51.550 --> 20:52.830
Wait, are you saying

319
20:53.500 --> 20:55.560
the bridge didn't collapse that day?

320
20:56.700 --> 20:57.760
This battle report

321
20:57.790 --> 20:58.880
was written by Mingxuan's adjutant,

322
20:58.880 --> 21:00.050
Jiang Chongyi.

323
21:00.330 --> 21:00.990
Adjutant Jiang

324
21:00.990 --> 21:02.010
left the army

325
21:02.010 --> 21:02.900
after the battle of Heishitan.

326
21:02.900 --> 21:03.680
He didn't take a single cent

327
21:03.680 --> 21:05.810
of the discharge pay he was entitled to

328
21:05.900 --> 21:07.560
under military regulations.

329
21:31.140 --> 21:32.400
Fifth Young Master Yu,

330
21:33.330 --> 21:34.530
what brings you here?

331
21:39.460 --> 21:40.350
I'm here

332
21:41.330 --> 21:43.390
to ask about the battle of Heishitan.

333
21:46.400 --> 21:48.180
I've reviewed the report again.

334
21:48.180 --> 21:49.660
I remember the heavy rain

335
21:50.220 --> 21:51.620
mentioned in the report.

336
21:52.050 --> 21:53.270
It was nowhere near

337
21:53.270 --> 21:56.070
severe enough to affect the original battle plan.

338
21:56.350 --> 21:58.850
Yes, well, the heavy rain triggered a flash flood

339
21:58.850 --> 21:59.660
that washed away a bridge

340
21:59.660 --> 22:01.000
we had to cross to retreat.

341
22:01.000 --> 22:02.570
T-There was nothing we could do.

342
22:02.570 --> 22:04.230
I never mentioned the bridge.

343
22:05.960 --> 22:07.330
I only said the report

344
22:07.720 --> 22:08.980
mentioned heavy rain.

345
22:12.250 --> 22:13.510
Why are you so nervous?

346
22:14.720 --> 22:16.320
What are you afraid I'll ask?

347
22:17.000 --> 22:17.600
B-Because

348
22:18.050 --> 22:20.380
the report says

349
22:21.460 --> 22:23.720
the heavy rain washed out Datong Bridge.

350
22:23.980 --> 22:25.010
I thought

351
22:25.530 --> 22:27.460
y-you were going to ask about that.

352
22:32.680 --> 22:35.110
I've checked reports from civilian sources.

353
22:35.110 --> 22:36.750
The day after the battle,

354
22:37.070 --> 22:38.930
villagers near Zhangjia Village

355
22:40.140 --> 22:41.000
crossed Datong Bridge

356
22:41.000 --> 22:42.460
as they moved away.

357
22:43.200 --> 22:45.000
The bridge was not washed away.

358
22:45.720 --> 22:47.160
The account in the report

359
22:48.510 --> 22:49.680
was fabricated.

360
22:51.460 --> 22:52.390
Adjutant Jiang,

361
22:53.570 --> 22:56.030
you still have an elderly mother to support.

362
22:56.510 --> 22:57.740
I hope you

363
22:59.010 --> 23:01.160
wouldn't let your silence

364
23:02.110 --> 23:03.510
bring trouble to her.

365
23:14.350 --> 23:16.210
The report was indeed falsified.

366
23:17.480 --> 23:19.720
The Army Commander's deployment had a flaw,

367
23:19.720 --> 23:21.920
and the Wan army discovered our ambush troops.

368
23:21.920 --> 23:23.350
To cover up that mistake,

369
23:24.310 --> 23:25.980
we had to change the plan.

370
23:26.250 --> 23:26.920
That's...

371
23:27.700 --> 23:29.360
That's why we made up the story

372
23:29.440 --> 23:31.440
about the bridge being washed away.

373
23:32.550 --> 23:33.550
Impossible.

374
23:34.510 --> 23:36.570
Mingxuan would never do such a thing.

375
23:37.380 --> 23:38.640
Fifth Young Master Yu,

376
23:40.480 --> 23:42.410
the Army Commander was only human.

377
23:43.790 --> 23:45.640
Everyone makes mistakes,

378
23:46.570 --> 23:49.030
and everyone has their own private motives.

379
23:56.980 --> 23:58.040
I'll take my leave.

380
24:19.390 --> 24:21.720
[III. Route Decisions and Tactical Adjustments]

381
24:31.960 --> 24:34.620
Still thinking about what Adjutant Jiang said?

382
24:40.660 --> 24:41.700
Adjutant Jiang's explanation

383
24:41.700 --> 24:42.880
does make sense.

384
24:44.110 --> 24:45.570
To maintain troop morale

385
24:45.900 --> 24:46.640
and preserve

386
24:46.640 --> 24:48.500
the Army Commander's authority,

387
24:49.380 --> 24:51.840
someone would have to come up with an excuse.

388
24:56.380 --> 24:57.180
But

389
25:02.980 --> 25:04.270
I know my brother.

390
25:06.980 --> 25:08.640
He would never do such a thing,

391
25:09.550 --> 25:10.440
nor would he stoop

392
25:10.440 --> 25:11.970
to using an excuse like that

393
25:13.590 --> 25:15.160
to cover up his own mistake.

394
25:21.090 --> 25:21.940
I understand.

395
25:23.750 --> 25:24.590
Don't wear yourself

396
25:24.590 --> 25:25.980
out over this.

397
25:26.420 --> 25:27.400
Go wash up.

398
25:27.550 --> 25:28.810
I'll take care of this.

399
25:32.400 --> 25:33.200
Go on.

400
26:04.530 --> 26:07.210
[Classified Archives of the Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

401
26:10.750 --> 26:12.080
On the day of the battle,

402
26:12.460 --> 26:14.960
Company Commander Yu Changxuan led a small squad

403
26:14.960 --> 26:16.920
to blow up an enemy weapons depot.

404
26:17.310 --> 26:18.770
The mission was a success.

405
26:23.770 --> 26:24.610
Could it be

406
26:25.570 --> 26:26.810
that Mingxuan was...

407
26:29.350 --> 26:31.350
You said you wanted to investigate.

408
26:31.550 --> 26:32.940
What have you found?

409
26:39.790 --> 26:40.920
I knew it.

410
26:42.030 --> 26:43.760
Your so-called investigation

411
26:45.110 --> 26:45.980
was just an excuse

412
26:45.980 --> 26:47.510
to make a few empty gestures

413
26:47.850 --> 26:49.920
in Ye Pingjun's defense.

414
26:50.770 --> 26:52.480
When have you ever

415
26:53.660 --> 26:56.120
genuinely cared about Mingxuan's affairs?

416
27:04.460 --> 27:05.720
Open it and take a look.

417
27:12.730 --> 27:15.480
[Archive]

418
27:15.480 --> 27:16.740
Look closely.

419
27:17.100 --> 27:17.460
[Military Dock Cargo Manifest]

420
27:17.460 --> 27:20.280
Back then, the Tao family's merchant ship, the Yongchang,

421
27:20.280 --> 27:20.660
[Military Dock Cargo Manifest]

422
27:20.660 --> 27:21.440
bore the insignia

423
27:21.440 --> 27:23.250
of the Yu Army.

424
27:24.070 --> 27:25.330
But the third shipment,

425
27:25.330 --> 27:25.860
sent on the 12th,

426
27:25.860 --> 27:27.480
[Military Dock Cargo Manifest]

427
27:27.480 --> 27:29.530
and the fifth and sixth shipments,

428
27:29.530 --> 27:30.880
sent on the 17th,

429
27:31.640 --> 27:32.730
all contained field guns

430
27:32.730 --> 27:35.590
desperately needed by the Wan army.

431
27:37.050 --> 27:39.250
We were certain to win the battle

432
27:39.300 --> 27:39.420
[Shipment Records]

433
27:39.420 --> 27:40.770
at Heishitan Harbor.

434
27:41.680 --> 27:42.670
But Tao Xili's shipment

435
27:42.670 --> 27:44.720
of military supplies

436
27:45.880 --> 27:48.830
greatly strengthened the Wan army's firepower,

437
27:49.270 --> 27:51.600
allowing them to launch a counterattack.

438
27:52.510 --> 27:53.640
Cat got your tongue?

439
27:55.680 --> 27:57.500
You have

440
27:57.500 --> 27:58.740
only two choices now.

441
27:58.960 --> 27:59.770
Either

442
28:01.160 --> 28:02.680
divorce Ye Pingjun,

443
28:03.880 --> 28:04.720
or

444
28:06.350 --> 28:08.180
I'll shoot her dead myself.

445
28:18.770 --> 28:20.700
I have nothing to say about Tao Xili

446
28:21.880 --> 28:23.080
funding the Wan army.

447
28:23.960 --> 28:25.980
But the defeat at Heishitan

448
28:27.750 --> 28:29.050
wasn't that simple.

449
28:29.880 --> 28:31.770
The Wan army had the upper hand from the start.

450
28:31.770 --> 28:33.850
It was always going to be a tough battle.

451
28:33.850 --> 28:36.780
My eldest brother managed to salvage the situation,

452
28:37.050 --> 28:39.050
but there were flaws in his operational planning and deployment.

453
28:39.050 --> 28:40.580
What are you talking about?

454
28:54.690 --> 28:58.530
[Investigation Records on the Battle of Heishitan]

455
28:58.530 --> 28:58.840
[The battle ultimately became a head-on engagement,]

456
28:58.870 --> 28:59.150
[a necessity imposed by the circumstances.]

457
28:59.170 --> 28:59.340
[The command decisions involved undisclosed matters]

458
28:59.340 --> 28:59.510
[but were necessary in the circumstances.]

459
28:59.530 --> 28:59.880
[The relevant circumstances have since been verified through investigation.]

460
29:01.310 --> 29:02.440
That's impossible.

461
29:03.310 --> 29:05.310
Mingxuan went over his battle plans

462
29:05.660 --> 29:07.520
again and again before the fight.

463
29:07.570 --> 29:09.570
He would never have been so careless

464
29:10.240 --> 29:12.370
as to change orders at the last minute.

465
29:17.850 --> 29:19.850
I know this is hard for you to accept,

466
29:20.510 --> 29:21.770
but my investigation

467
29:22.920 --> 29:24.650
shows that these are the facts.

468
29:28.770 --> 29:29.570
Yu Changxuan,

469
29:32.310 --> 29:34.420
you're actually making this up

470
29:34.750 --> 29:36.750
to smear your own eldest brother,

471
29:37.250 --> 29:39.680
all to protect Ye Pingjun?

472
29:52.310 --> 29:53.680
Even now,

473
29:55.250 --> 29:56.400
you'd rather believe

474
29:56.400 --> 29:57.980
I'm making things up

475
29:58.920 --> 29:59.810
than accept

476
29:59.810 --> 30:01.470
that Mingxuan made a mistake.

477
30:02.460 --> 30:03.850
I should have known.

478
30:04.750 --> 30:05.980
In your eyes,

479
30:06.740 --> 30:08.270
I'm always the one at fault,

480
30:09.310 --> 30:11.040
while Mingxuan can do no wrong.

481
30:11.880 --> 30:13.350
He's always the best.

482
30:13.720 --> 30:15.580
And why shouldn't I believe that?

483
30:15.770 --> 30:17.030
Everyone in the army

484
30:17.250 --> 30:18.530
knows how meticulous and cautious

485
30:18.530 --> 30:20.090
Mingxuan was.

486
30:20.510 --> 30:21.960
Do you expect me to believe

487
30:21.960 --> 30:23.310
he'd make such a blatant mistake

488
30:23.310 --> 30:25.160
on the battlefield?

489
30:25.160 --> 30:26.550
Believe what you want!

490
30:26.550 --> 30:27.940
But Yu Mingxuan cannot escape responsibility

491
30:27.940 --> 30:29.570
for the defeat at Heishitan!

492
30:29.660 --> 30:31.750
You despicable, shameless bastard!

493
30:38.750 --> 30:41.280
The defeat was no fault of the Army Commander.

494
30:42.850 --> 30:44.250
Commander-in-Chief Yu.

495
30:49.180 --> 30:50.440
Fifth Young Master Yu.

496
30:57.660 --> 30:58.960
I brought him here.

497
31:00.290 --> 31:01.220
Adjutant Jiang,

498
31:02.250 --> 31:03.220
yesterday, while helping Changxuan

499
31:03.220 --> 31:04.680
organize some documents,

500
31:05.480 --> 31:07.440
I noticed another file

501
31:07.440 --> 31:09.500
beside the Heishitan battle report.

502
31:10.850 --> 31:13.140
It documented Changxuan leading a small squad

503
31:13.140 --> 31:15.340
to blow up the Wan army's weapons depot.

504
31:16.090 --> 31:17.020
Adjutant Jiang,

505
31:17.640 --> 31:19.440
do you know anything about this?

506
31:19.700 --> 31:20.850
You've served under Mingxuan

507
31:20.850 --> 31:21.850
for so many years.

508
31:22.160 --> 31:23.380
You should know

509
31:23.700 --> 31:25.110
what kind of man he was.

510
31:26.660 --> 31:27.570
Yet

511
31:28.460 --> 31:30.010
you'd rather

512
31:30.010 --> 31:31.340
tarnish his reputation

513
31:31.460 --> 31:34.120
than reconsider your account of what happened.

514
31:34.350 --> 31:35.590
Unless

515
31:38.030 --> 31:39.760
there's another truth you have

516
31:40.050 --> 31:42.110
an even greater reason to protect.

517
31:48.180 --> 31:49.460
Everyone knows

518
31:50.840 --> 31:52.240
how devoted Mingxuan was

519
31:52.590 --> 31:54.350
to his younger brothers.

520
31:55.480 --> 31:57.460
But few understand

521
31:58.570 --> 32:00.720
how much Mingxuan meant to Changxuan.

522
32:02.270 --> 32:03.730
Changxuan has never truly

523
32:04.510 --> 32:06.720
come to terms with Mingxuan's death.

524
32:07.960 --> 32:08.790
The pain

525
32:09.400 --> 32:10.660
has tormented him

526
32:11.000 --> 32:12.480
day and night.

527
32:14.290 --> 32:16.660
But pretending a wound isn't there

528
32:17.000 --> 32:18.590
will only let it fester.

529
32:19.480 --> 32:21.940
Cutting away the diseased flesh is painful,

530
32:22.510 --> 32:23.500
but it's the only way

531
32:23.500 --> 32:24.720
to heal.

532
32:40.180 --> 32:41.440
Fifth Young Master Yu,

533
32:41.510 --> 32:42.880
the Army Commander originally

534
32:42.880 --> 32:45.050
forbade me from revealing a single word

535
32:45.050 --> 32:46.780
about what happened back then.

536
32:55.250 --> 32:57.250
We'll continue our feigned retreat

537
32:57.660 --> 32:59.380
and lure the enemy into this valley.

538
32:59.380 --> 33:00.200
We'll close the net at daybreak.

539
33:00.200 --> 33:00.730
Yes, sir.

540
33:01.460 --> 33:02.250
Report!

541
33:03.180 --> 33:03.920
Report, Army Commander!

542
33:03.920 --> 33:05.320
Company Commander Yu...

543
33:05.380 --> 33:06.050
What is it?

544
33:06.050 --> 33:07.400
He took his men out without authorization

545
33:07.400 --> 33:09.380
to destroy the enemy's weapons depot.

546
33:09.380 --> 33:10.200
Outrageous!

547
33:10.830 --> 33:12.050
How long ago did he leave?

548
33:12.050 --> 33:13.570
About half an hour ago.

549
33:13.770 --> 33:14.720
Half an hour...

550
33:16.790 --> 33:17.790
Pass down my order.

551
33:17.790 --> 33:19.630
Have the main force counterattack immediately.

552
33:19.630 --> 33:20.660
Send men to find Changxuan

553
33:20.660 --> 33:21.940
and bring him back safely.

554
33:21.940 --> 33:22.500
Yes, sir!

555
33:22.720 --> 33:24.160
Army Commander, if we launch a frontal attack now,

556
33:24.160 --> 33:25.510
all our efforts will have been in vain.

557
33:25.510 --> 33:26.440
There's no time.

558
33:26.750 --> 33:27.460
Once he makes his move,

559
33:27.460 --> 33:28.860
our plan will be exposed.

560
33:29.050 --> 33:29.680
Our only chance is

561
33:29.680 --> 33:31.270
to fight our way through head-on.

562
33:31.270 --> 33:32.590
But changing the entire army's strategy

563
33:32.590 --> 33:33.510
at the last minute...

564
33:33.510 --> 33:36.310
Who could possibly take responsibility for that?

565
33:38.750 --> 33:39.450
I will.

566
33:42.400 --> 33:44.260
The Army Commander instructed me

567
33:44.340 --> 33:45.870
to cover it up in the report.

568
33:46.310 --> 33:47.500
I had no choice but

569
33:47.850 --> 33:51.310
to make up a story about heavy rain washing away Datong Bridge.

570
34:00.160 --> 34:00.960
You're lying!

571
34:01.570 --> 34:02.750
When I came to you, you said nothing.

572
34:02.750 --> 34:04.050
Now you're making all this up.

573
34:04.050 --> 34:05.160
Fifth Young Master Yu,

574
34:05.160 --> 34:06.570
I'm telling you the truth.

575
34:06.570 --> 34:07.510
Do you remember?

576
34:08.110 --> 34:08.760
We were

577
34:09.510 --> 34:11.840
vastly outmatched by the enemy back then.

578
34:12.050 --> 34:12.650
If we hadn't

579
34:12.650 --> 34:13.860
covered this up,

580
34:14.360 --> 34:15.210
why would the Army Commander

581
34:15.210 --> 34:17.469
have chosen to engage the enemy head-on?

582
34:33.190 --> 34:34.699
Army Commander, the enemy is too strong!

583
34:34.699 --> 34:35.760
We need to retreat!

584
34:36.980 --> 34:37.670
Retreat!

585
34:46.510 --> 34:47.770
Hurry up! Keep moving!

586
34:52.880 --> 34:53.880
Go help them, too.

587
34:54.030 --> 34:55.230
Yes, Army Commander.

588
35:03.570 --> 35:04.630
Fifth Young Master Yu, what are you doing here?

589
35:04.630 --> 35:05.420
Where's the Army Commander?

590
35:05.420 --> 35:06.480
This way, this way!

591
35:07.670 --> 35:10.270
Army Commander, Fifth Young Master Yu is here.

592
35:12.860 --> 35:13.990
Who told you to come?

593
35:14.190 --> 35:16.120
Didn't I tell you to return to camp?

594
35:21.570 --> 35:23.690
Never act on your own again.

595
35:23.710 --> 35:24.440
Understand?

596
35:24.710 --> 35:25.280
Army Commander,

597
35:25.280 --> 35:26.340
I'm a soldier, too.

598
35:26.380 --> 35:27.670
Stop shielding me all the time.

599
35:27.670 --> 35:31.070
When there's a battle to fight, I should be on the front lines.

600
35:31.400 --> 35:32.320
Don't be reckless!

601
35:32.320 --> 35:33.570
Do you see how much firepower they have?

602
35:33.570 --> 35:34.970
Are we any match for them?

603
35:36.650 --> 35:37.340
Come back!

604
35:37.400 --> 35:38.260
Leave me alone!

605
35:38.460 --> 35:39.250
Come back!

606
35:39.860 --> 35:40.460
Come back!

607
35:43.900 --> 35:44.650
Changxuan!

608
35:58.440 --> 35:59.770
The Army Commander said

609
36:00.050 --> 36:01.940
that on your first time on the battlefield,

610
36:01.940 --> 36:04.030
you were already being saddled with such a grave accusation.

611
36:04.030 --> 36:05.560
Knowing your temperament,

612
36:06.360 --> 36:08.490
he couldn't just stand by and watch you

613
36:08.900 --> 36:10.830
suffer such a devastating setback

614
36:10.980 --> 36:13.380
when you'd only just embarked on this path.

615
36:18.380 --> 36:19.760
You're lying.

616
36:20.760 --> 36:22.460
Why would he do that?

617
36:23.780 --> 36:25.670
Of course he had his reasons.

618
36:28.320 --> 36:30.070
I know you've always

619
36:31.170 --> 36:32.460
resented me

620
36:32.570 --> 36:35.100
for saving Mingxuan instead of you back then.

621
36:36.360 --> 36:37.510
You've always been biased

622
36:37.510 --> 36:39.170
against your eldest brother.

623
36:39.980 --> 36:40.380
Commander-in-Chief!

624
36:40.380 --> 36:40.650
Where?

625
36:40.650 --> 36:42.850
The forward command post is over there!

626
36:43.800 --> 36:45.380
-Move that beam! -Hurry!

627
36:48.860 --> 36:49.500
Mingxuan.

628
36:50.210 --> 36:50.860
Mingxuan.

629
36:51.400 --> 36:52.000
Mingxuan.

630
36:52.880 --> 36:53.510
Mingxuan!

631
36:53.710 --> 36:54.510
Commander-in-Chief!

632
36:54.510 --> 36:56.170
Fifth Young Master Yu is here!

633
36:56.360 --> 36:57.690
Fifth Young Master Yu is here!

634
36:57.690 --> 36:58.130
Good!

635
36:58.590 --> 36:59.400
Get him out!

636
36:59.400 --> 36:59.990
Yes, sir!

637
37:02.380 --> 37:03.640
Fifth Young Master Yu!

638
37:03.820 --> 37:04.420
Over here!

639
37:06.590 --> 37:07.280
Changxuan.

640
37:07.460 --> 37:08.260
Company Commander!

641
37:08.260 --> 37:09.400
-Changxuan! -Company Commander!

642
37:09.400 --> 37:11.130
Hurry! Can you hear me?

643
37:11.440 --> 37:11.880
Hurry!

644
37:12.130 --> 37:12.940
Changxuan!

645
37:13.460 --> 37:14.420
Can you hear me?

646
37:15.190 --> 37:16.390
Hurry! Carry him out!

647
37:18.610 --> 37:19.420
Commander-in-Chief!

648
37:19.420 --> 37:21.480
The Army Commander has been rescued!

649
37:21.510 --> 37:22.010
Stop!

650
37:28.010 --> 37:28.650
Mingxuan.

651
37:29.960 --> 37:30.560
Mingxuan.

652
37:32.300 --> 37:33.440
We need to save Mingxuan first.

653
37:33.440 --> 37:34.460
Get him out of here first.

654
37:34.460 --> 37:35.590
-Yes, sir! -Yes, sir!

655
37:35.590 --> 37:36.850
Get an ambulance here!

656
37:36.860 --> 37:37.430
Hurry!

657
37:37.980 --> 37:39.030
Someone give us a hand! Quickly!

658
37:39.030 --> 37:40.630
Carry him out! Hurry, hurry!

659
37:41.000 --> 37:41.930
-Hurry! -Hurry.

660
37:45.460 --> 37:46.360
Can you hold on?

661
37:46.630 --> 37:47.830
Hang in there. Get up.

662
37:49.920 --> 37:50.670
Changxuan!

663
37:52.010 --> 37:52.670
Changxuan!

664
37:54.610 --> 37:55.280
Commander-in-Chief,

665
37:55.280 --> 37:56.380
our reinforcements

666
37:56.380 --> 37:57.320
are still on their way.

667
37:57.320 --> 37:58.510
They won't arrive anytime soon.

668
37:58.510 --> 37:59.610
This place is too dangerous.

669
37:59.610 --> 38:00.800
You must withdraw

670
38:00.800 --> 38:01.480
to the rear command post immediately!

671
38:01.480 --> 38:02.070
No!

672
38:02.340 --> 38:03.610
We have to get Changxuan out!

673
38:03.610 --> 38:05.340
Commander Yu, you're the commander-in-chief,

674
38:05.340 --> 38:06.420
the overall commander.

675
38:06.420 --> 38:08.090
You must put the bigger picture first!

676
38:08.090 --> 38:09.350
Commander-in-Chief!

677
38:09.670 --> 38:10.660
Commander-in-Chief!

678
38:10.660 --> 38:11.720
Leave this to me.

679
38:11.820 --> 38:13.000
I swear on my life

680
38:13.110 --> 38:14.610
that I'll get Fifth Young Master Yu out.

681
38:14.610 --> 38:16.870
If I fail, I'll answer for it with my life!

682
38:19.960 --> 38:20.360
Hurry!

683
38:22.500 --> 38:23.500
Commander-in-Chief,

684
38:23.500 --> 38:24.920
forgive me for what I'm about to do.

685
38:24.920 --> 38:26.320
Quickly! Get the Commander-in-Chief out of here!

686
38:26.320 --> 38:27.130
Commander-in-Chief, we must go!

687
38:27.130 --> 38:27.930
Take him away!

688
38:29.070 --> 38:29.480
Take him away!

689
38:29.480 --> 38:31.090
How dare you!

690
38:31.300 --> 38:31.820
You...

691
38:31.820 --> 38:32.800
Save the Fifth Young Master Yu!

692
38:32.800 --> 38:34.340
How dare you!

693
38:34.500 --> 38:35.360
Hurry up and go!

694
38:45.190 --> 38:46.480
Changxuan...

695
38:49.590 --> 38:50.630
Changxuan...

696
38:51.780 --> 38:52.400
Turn back!

697
38:53.300 --> 38:53.920
Army Commander,

698
38:53.920 --> 38:55.230
you need immediate medical attention,

699
38:55.230 --> 38:56.890
or your life will be in danger.

700
39:00.630 --> 39:01.800
That's an order.

701
39:02.400 --> 39:03.340
Turn back!

702
39:04.010 --> 39:04.710
Turn back!

703
39:17.920 --> 39:18.590
I know

704
39:20.860 --> 39:23.610
you've always been biased against your eldest brother.

705
39:23.610 --> 39:25.070
But have you ever wondered

706
39:25.800 --> 39:26.510
why he went back

707
39:26.510 --> 39:28.920
to Qingshi Ridge and was killed

708
39:29.500 --> 39:31.340
in the explosion

709
39:32.590 --> 39:33.990
after he'd already left?

710
40:02.980 --> 40:05.310
You're making up such an outrageous story

711
40:07.340 --> 40:09.030
just to defend Yu Mingxuan.

712
40:18.980 --> 40:20.010
Your mother and I

713
40:21.540 --> 40:22.650
had intended to take this

714
40:22.650 --> 40:24.840
to our graves.

715
40:28.280 --> 40:29.920
Now you know everything.

716
40:33.210 --> 40:34.300
Are you satisfied?

717
40:40.000 --> 40:40.930
There's no need.

718
40:45.510 --> 40:47.640
You don't have to beat around the bush.

719
40:57.190 --> 40:58.210
No.

720
41:00.090 --> 41:00.950
No, it can't be.

721
41:01.650 --> 41:02.340
Mother,

722
41:05.190 --> 41:07.010
they're lying, aren't they?

723
41:08.510 --> 41:10.240
My brother didn't die this way.

724
41:11.420 --> 41:12.300
Changxuan.

725
41:14.010 --> 41:14.960
I'm sorry.

726
41:16.710 --> 41:18.030
I'm so sorry.

727
41:25.090 --> 41:26.690
You should understand

728
41:27.900 --> 41:30.360
that your eldest brother

729
41:32.230 --> 41:34.420
never wronged you.

730
41:34.840 --> 41:37.110
Please, stop talking.

731
41:39.320 --> 41:40.650
You're all lying to me!

732
41:42.110 --> 41:43.610
All of you!

733
41:43.920 --> 41:44.840
It can't be!

734
41:45.070 --> 41:46.800
My brother didn't die this way!

735
41:46.900 --> 41:49.280
-No! No! -Changxuan.

736
41:49.280 --> 41:50.110
Changxuan.

737
42:01.580 --> 42:05.310
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother, Yu Mingxuan]

738
42:17.010 --> 42:17.920
Yu Mingxuan.

739
42:20.420 --> 42:21.430
Do you think

740
42:21.460 --> 42:22.710
you're so great?

741
42:24.690 --> 42:26.500
You think you're so noble?

742
42:28.690 --> 42:30.820
Do you think you're some kind of saint?

743
42:32.800 --> 42:34.980
Did I ask you to die in my place?

744
42:40.000 --> 42:41.030
Answer me.

745
42:42.420 --> 42:44.840
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother, Yu Mingxuan]

746
42:47.110 --> 42:48.300
Who gave you the right

747
42:48.300 --> 42:49.560
to die in my place?

748
42:49.590 --> 42:52.060
I don't need your self-righteousness!

749
43:12.260 --> 43:12.900
I'd rather

750
43:12.900 --> 43:15.900
have been the one who was punished under military law.

751
43:18.000 --> 43:18.670
I'd rather

752
43:18.670 --> 43:20.800
have been the one put in the pillory.

753
43:25.800 --> 43:28.010
I'd rather have been the one who died.

754
43:44.190 --> 43:45.260
Do you think

755
43:45.260 --> 43:47.790
that means I'll owe you for the rest of my life?

756
43:52.340 --> 43:53.270
I'm telling you,

757
43:57.950 --> 43:58.680
I won't.

758
44:00.350 --> 44:02.750
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother, Yu Mingxuan]

759
44:05.800 --> 44:06.900
Never.

760
44:51.460 --> 44:52.720
Second Young Lady Tao.

761
45:03.150 --> 45:04.080
Long time no see.

762
45:10.460 --> 45:11.210
You're the man

763
45:11.210 --> 45:13.280
my uncle arranged for me to meet?

764
45:14.760 --> 45:17.670
The newly appointed Director of the Propaganda Department?

765
45:17.670 --> 45:18.600
That would be me.

766
45:30.150 --> 45:33.150
This is nothing but another marriage of convenience.

767
45:33.650 --> 45:34.760
I won't accept it.

768
45:34.860 --> 45:35.990
What a coincidence.

769
45:37.050 --> 45:37.540
I have no interest

770
45:37.540 --> 45:39.380
in spoiled, arrogant rich girls

771
45:39.860 --> 45:40.960
either.

772
45:44.260 --> 45:45.510
My uncle said

773
45:45.510 --> 45:47.570
you were a real lapdog,

774
45:47.960 --> 45:49.420
so I came to see for myself.

775
45:49.820 --> 45:52.610
Looks like a limping dog

776
45:53.980 --> 45:55.170
bites even harder.

777
45:56.280 --> 45:57.810
Then we're a perfect match.

778
45:58.380 --> 46:01.210
Weren't you the one whose engagement was broken off,

779
46:01.210 --> 46:03.210
leaving you with nowhere to go, too?

780
46:06.200 --> 46:07.020
Last month,

781
46:07.610 --> 46:09.480
your uncle shipped three boatloads

782
46:09.480 --> 46:10.960
of illicit salt through Baiyundu Pier.

783
46:10.960 --> 46:11.670
Guess who

784
46:13.300 --> 46:15.030
buried that story?

785
46:15.030 --> 46:15.890
And this month,

786
46:16.600 --> 46:18.980
your family smuggled a huge amount of iron ore.

787
46:18.980 --> 46:19.960
Now guess

788
46:20.460 --> 46:21.030
why the papers haven't said

789
46:21.030 --> 46:22.710
a word about it.

790
46:27.980 --> 46:30.840
Secretary Jiang, you've certainly come a long way.

791
46:32.460 --> 46:33.570
But why

792
46:33.820 --> 46:35.780
would I marry a rabid dog

793
46:36.070 --> 46:39.000
who barely escaped death?

794
46:39.130 --> 46:40.230
Because we both

795
46:43.460 --> 46:44.840
hate Yu Changxuan

796
46:45.960 --> 46:47.210
to the core.

797
47:10.550 --> 47:12.130
We're not here to talk about love

798
47:12.130 --> 47:13.130
or marriage.

799
47:13.360 --> 47:15.160
We're here to discuss business.

800
47:15.480 --> 47:16.810
What do you have in mind?

801
47:17.030 --> 47:18.360
I have Commander Mu backing me,

802
47:18.360 --> 47:19.460
and I hold a key position at the heart

803
47:19.460 --> 47:21.360
of the government's Propaganda Department.

804
47:21.360 --> 47:21.970
Now I need

805
47:22.000 --> 47:23.650
the Tang family's financial support

806
47:23.650 --> 47:24.380
to make sure I can

807
47:24.380 --> 47:25.550
utterly ruin

808
47:25.670 --> 47:26.670
Yu Changxuan

809
47:27.690 --> 47:29.420
in the shortest possible time.

810
47:31.360 --> 47:32.980
You make it sound so grand,

811
47:33.460 --> 47:35.320
but isn't this all for Ye Pingjun?

812
47:35.420 --> 47:36.210
Exactly.

813
47:38.480 --> 47:39.360
So we only need

814
47:39.360 --> 47:40.760
to be married in name.

815
47:41.150 --> 47:43.080
I won't interfere in your affairs.

816
47:43.340 --> 47:44.690
As in-laws,

817
47:45.130 --> 47:46.110
we'll rise

818
47:46.110 --> 47:47.170
and fall together.

819
47:48.360 --> 47:51.220
You won't have to worry about where I stand, either.

820
47:54.530 --> 47:56.010
I remember

821
47:56.010 --> 47:57.670
you weren't like this before.

822
47:59.400 --> 48:01.000
What happened to your pride?

823
48:06.050 --> 48:07.420
I've simply realized

824
48:07.800 --> 48:08.860
that sometimes,

825
48:09.710 --> 48:11.690
what makes or breaks you

826
48:13.090 --> 48:14.890
has nothing to do with you at all.

827
48:15.190 --> 48:16.450
One person's strength

828
48:17.110 --> 48:18.770
is like a lone boat lost at sea.

829
48:18.920 --> 48:20.780
I have to leverage those in power,

830
48:20.780 --> 48:22.190
rise to the top,

831
48:25.010 --> 48:26.500
and make the rules.
